      "message": "Potentially unsafe model attribute in `link_to` href",
      "file": "app/views/plants/show.html.erb",
      "line": 40,
      "note": "Closed twice over. Plant#reference_url has a model validation anchored at both ends (%r{\\Ahttps?://\\S+\\z}i), so no non-http(s) scheme can be saved through any path that runs validations; and the view calls Plant#safe_reference_url, which re-parses at render time and returns nil unless the result is a URI::HTTP. The second check covers rows written around the validation — a console session, a restored backup. Brakeman flags any model attribute in an href and cannot see either guard."
    }
